<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .form-label {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .line-item-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .line-item-table td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">1</div>
  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">SPECIAL CONSIDERATION (other than Dependency Override)</h2>
  <h3 style="text-align: center;">STUDENT REQUEST FORM</h3>
  <p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">For Academic Year {{ academic_year }}</p>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span class="form-label">Name:</span> <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <span class="form-label">Student ID#:</span> <span data-field="student_id">{{ student_id }}</span>
  </div>

  <p>You have experienced a change in the current economic condition of your household that is not accurately reflected on your financial aid application. You understand that you must thoroughly explain your request for reconsideration and will submit all supporting documentation requested by the Financial Aid Office.</p>

  <p>Another type of special circumstance that may affect your eligibility for aid includes participation in a study abroad program or taking an unusually heavy credit load at DU. If you encounter either of these situations, you may qualify for an increase in your student budget (Cost of Attendance) based upon the program costs and you should also complete a special consideration form. We will not adjust a student's budget for any reason other than Davenport-related expenses.</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <span class="form-label">Student's Hand-Signature</span>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 30px; margin-top: 5px;" data-field="student_s_hand_signature">{{ student_s_hand_signature }}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <span class="form-label">Date</span>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 30px; margin-top: 5px;" data-field="date">{{ date }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <span class="form-label">Student Email Address</span>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px; margin-top: 5px;" data-field="student_email_address">{{ student_email_address }}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <span class="form-label">Phone Number</span>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px; margin-top: 5px;" data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: 40px;">Please explain your special circumstance to have the Financial Aid Office at Davenport University re-evaluate your financial aid status.</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-bottom: 10px;" data-field="phone_number_2">{{ phone_number_2 }}</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-bottom: 10px;" data-field="field_1">{{ field_1 }}</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-bottom: 10px;" data-field="field_2">{{ field_2 }}</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-bottom: 10px;" data-field="field_3">{{ field_3 }}</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-bottom: 10px;" data-field="field_4">{{ field_4 }}</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-bottom: 10px;" data-field="field_5">{{ field_5 }}</div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 100px; text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;">Office Use Only—FA-SCF</div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">2</div>
  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">SPECIAL CONSIDERATION</h2>
  <h3 style="text-align: center;">INCOME REDUCTION</h3>
  <p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">Academic Year {{ academic_year }}</p>

